kind: autotools
(@): elements/musl/musl.yml

description: |
  musl 1.1.24 built by tcc against the Mes C library, as live-bootstrap does
  first: without what needs headers generated by tools the Mes C library
  cannot run, and without complex types, which tcc lacks.  On x86_64 the
  assembly math functions that need SSE instructions tcc cannot assemble are
  left out, and musl's own C ones are used.

build-depends:
  (>):
  - tcc/tcc.bst
